    <title>E48丨聊聊《初步举证》和《还有明天》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67de8df778103db3bd2b30df</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67de8df778103db3bd2b30df</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 10:25:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@思佳</span></p><span></span><p><span>@桃子</span></p><span></span><p><span>@流羽</span></p><span></span><p><span>----</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下为豆包ai 生成：</span></p><span></span><p><span>围绕《初步举证》和《还有明天》展开讨论。《初步举证》以独角戏呈现女律师成为性侵受害者后对法律体系的质疑与抗争，其中有母亲对女儿的支持、性侵场景引发思考，还探讨了社会对受害者要求及男女平权责任。而《还有明天》虽打着女性主义旗号却存在女主缺乏反抗意识、有刻板印象、严肃与搞笑结合不当等问题，播客对这类名不副实的作品进行了批判。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> 《初步举证》与《还有明天》开场讨论	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 主播刘宇邀朋友聊两部电影	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 桃子看电影易共情，提到房思琪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="264">04:24</a> 桃子介绍《初步举证》剧情	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 思佳从宏观角度看电影	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> 批判《还有明天》女主无反抗意识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 《还有明天》的问题探讨	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 讨论《初步举证》和《还有明天》的问题	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">19:13</a> 《还有明天》女主有榜样却未往女性主义发展	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a> 《还有明天》女主思想转变支持女儿上学	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 讨厌打着女性主义旗号却不女性主义的作品	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a> 女主闺蜜劝女主别逃跑，充满刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 《还有明天》中的刻板印象分析	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2764">46:04</a> 《初步举证》以独特视角呈现女性遭遇	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">47:56</a> 女主被拒载后意识转变，是剧的转折	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2961">49:21</a> 法庭上母亲形象体现人的力量	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3062">51:02</a> 母亲的衣服对女主有象征意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a> 电影中母亲的支持与触动	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a> 《初步举证》中母亲支持女儿，令人触动	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3299">54:59</a> 母亲鼓励女儿，给予其很大支持	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a> 电影强调男女朋友等关系中也可能性侵	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3685">01:01:25</a> 男主不认为自己性侵，态度令人气愤	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3907">01:05:07</a> 应关注加害者，而非苛求受害者完美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4113">01:08:33</a> 电影情节引发的平权思考	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4118">01:08:38</a> 电影《初步举证》引发平权思考	</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4432">01:13:52</a> 影视灌输奇怪思想致女性观念扭曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4639">01:17:19</a> 平权需男女共同努力打破枷锁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4791">01:19:51</a> 男生对女性友好行为希望渺茫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5104">01:25:04</a> 讨论充分，下期再聊新话题</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也对录播客有兴趣，请看看这里：</span><a href="https://flowus.cn/wxsl/share/d934e48e-8b65-4731-82d9-f6229ce4a0df?code=TDFPS5" data-url="https://flowus.cn/wxsl/share/d934e48e-8b65-4731-82d9-f6229ce4a0df?code=TDFPS5"><span>长期招募播客嘉宾</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>另外，我们现在也有听友群了！你可以选择添加微信号： wanxiangslly &nbsp;来加群</span></p>]]></description>
