    <title>E47丨租房的坑也太多了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678bbdc39420ede9d1003c6d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678bbdc39420ede9d1003c6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Jan 2025 15:14:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@思佳</span></p><span></span><p><span>@流羽</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>一句话，租房都是坑啊……</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是豆包AI总结的时间线</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>P1租房起因及费用讨论</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">00:01:48</a>博主因房租贵想换住处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">00:02:51</a>讨论深圳租房设施情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">00:06:26</a>牵网线需付费且非免费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">00:09:21</a>大学毕业首次合租经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">00:13:02</a>合租卫生问题难沟通</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>P2&nbsp;</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">00:15:53</a> 合租的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">00:21:51</a> 合租体验不佳，打破幻想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">00:25:05</a> 首个租房踩坑多，有二房东问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1776">00:29:36</a> 深圳租房男女分住，有卫浴等配置但仍有问题</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>P3找房与转租的坑</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">00:31:47</a>博主吐槽深圳租房，找房转租问题多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">00:39:12</a>深圳租房找一手房东难，中介坑多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2513">00:41:53</a>找房要实地看，确认周围环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">00:43:03</a>转租麻烦，房东让租客自己转租</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2711">00:45:11</a>合同未写明违约处理，转租成难题</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>P4租房问题初现</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2852">00:47:32</a>租房问题初现，房东让房客转租</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3065">00:51:05</a>房东让房客找洗洗衣机的人，态度摆烂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3233">00:53:53</a>租房遇假房源中介，产业链复杂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">00:57:20</a>租房过程坎坷，结果还算满意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3674">01:01:14</a>总结租房经验，要懂法律知识</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>P5新租公寓与经验分享</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3798">01:03:18</a>博主讲述租房糟心经历，分享新租公寓情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4018">01:06:58</a>中介带看与熟人介绍租房价格差别大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4271">01:11:11</a>讨论租房与买房，认为现在买房非好选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4426">01:13:46</a>博主短期内不打算搬，强调租房经验重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4542">01:15:42</a>租房前要搞清楚给钱、服务等问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>--</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也对录播客有兴趣，请看看这里：</span><a href="https://flowus.cn/wxsl/share/d934e48e-8b65-4731-82d9-f6229ce4a0df?code=TDFPS5" data-url="https://flowus.cn/wxsl/share/d934e48e-8b65-4731-82d9-f6229ce4a0df?code=TDFPS5"><span>长期招募播客嘉宾</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>另外，我们现在也有听友群了！你可以选择添加微信号： wanxiangslly &nbsp;来加群</span></p>]]></description>
